              }
            ]
          },
          "text": "The English edition of KiraEqual’s 2026 China Transgender Living Conditions Survey is now available.\n\nThis report presents a systematic analysis of the living conditions of transgender people in China, covering areas including healthcare, education, employment, family relationships, social environment, safety, and mental well-being.\n\nThe Chinese edition was published previously. With the release of the English edition, we hope to make the findings more accessible to international researchers, journalists, organizations, and anyone interested in understanding the lived experiences of transgender people in China.\n\nThank you to everyone who participated in the survey, shared it, contributed their experiences, or helped make this report possible.\n\nRead the English report:\nhttps://t.co/BBRiAnaTYO"
        },
